    "subType": "cyberware",
    "description": "<p><strong>Price $80,000 &middot; Concealment Touch &middot; System Strain 2</strong></p><p>Heavier subcutaneous plating acts as Dermal Armor I with a base ranged and melee AC of 18. In addition, the user can ignore the first instance of Shock in a round (not modeled by an Active Effect -- there is no \"ignore first Shock instance\" target in the registry, only full Shock immunity; apply by hand). The base-AC bonus does not stack additively with Dermal Armor I/III -- all three target the same innate-AC floor, so having more than one installed simply keeps the highest.</p>",
